A||||10||Fformula88||Some people need to learn their capabilities||||1||
Z||000000||Fformula88||11-02-2001||03:22 PM||||Last night I had the Fiero out for a rare drive between rainy and cold fall days.  Sitting at a light this young punk in a Saturn pulls up next to me and flashes me the look athat screams "I am a young punk a$$ kid, and I intend on smoking your slow a$$ from this light."  My first thought was he's gotta have mods on that car to be acting this way.  Then I took a closer look:  stock tires and rims, no tint, no big wing... certainly looked stock unless it was a sleeper.  My gut told me the car was probably stock, maybe some minor bolt ons, and he simply figured my Formula was any other iron duke powerd notchback out there.  As the turning lane traffic finished its turn in front of us he thought he would get a jump on me so took off, then laid on the brakes as the light hadn't changed!  I knew he wanted to go then, and also that he wasn't that fast.  I brake toqued just a tad, the light turned green, and by the time I hit 45 I had 2 and a half car lengths at least on him.  Yeah, he did floor it from the light, but it is a Saturn, and probably an automatic!<P>If he wasn't showing off so bad, I wouldn't have bothered... and wouldn't have considered toasting him from the light.  However, since he had to be such an idiot about it I felt it was my duty to teach him a lesson in humility, and not to take on V6 cars with a stock 1.9L Saturn.  These punks really ought to read up on cars so they know who they are up against!||||reg||1
