Z||000004||fldevel||11-02-2001||06:33 PM||||i had soem kid in some acura im not sure what make but it looked like a honda prelude but it had all the acura badging..anyway he was toying with me at lights trying to get me to race him  the car sounded like it had no exhaust at all and i finaly decided to punch it at the next light and he also did and i belive i whipped him by say 6 car lenghts...silly skinhead  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
