Z||000006||fierosound||11-02-2001||06:50 PM||||Wish I was driving my Fiero for this one, but even so, you won't be reading about this on the Toyota Celica board.  <P>I'm sitting at the light. In the curb lane is some punk in a new Celica.  There are parked cars a block block up ahead in his lane.  By his antics, it's obvious he plans to "scoop" me through the intersection and pull in front of me before he gets to the parked cars.<P>When the light turns green, I floor it and he cannot pull on me to get in front (only doing about 40mph).  He has to brake heavily and pull in behind.  In ricer fashion, he flies past me on the right once his lane clears.  <P>Only then he realizes he needs to make a left run at the next street.  He's too close and fast to bother signalling, and cuts a hard left, one he can't make. I see smoke coming off all 4 tires as he nails the brakes hard as he's headed straight for the curb, stopping just inches short of wrecking his front-end.<P>As he's trying to back up etc.  I give him a couple toots on my 94 Plymouth Grand Voyager van's horn as I pass.<P>I hope he learned a couple things:  his car has no off-line torque, handles only so-so, and he probably can't driver either!!!||||reg||10
Z||000007||Cheever3000||11-02-2001||07:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>this young punk in a Saturn pulls up next to me and flashes me the look athat screams "I am a young punk a$$ kid, and I intend on smoking your slow a$$ from this light."<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>So you were making eye contact?  That'll get you in trouble some day.  I figure they don't even deserve my attention.  Besides, I might sprain my neck looking over at them.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000008||88CoupeV6||11-02-2001||09:51 PM||||LMAO. I would have loved to see that and to have more light ahead to hear his reaction.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
Z||000009||Fformula88||11-02-2001||10:12 PM||||Wasn't really eye contact.  I was sitting at the light lookin around and when this car pulls up next to me I glanced in its direction.  It pulled slightly ahead of me and the driver turned his head all te way around to glare at me a sec then look back ahead.<P>I normally wouldn't bother with a street race like that except this kid was really askin for it.  I am not an advocate of it, although I always let off the gas at or righ over the speed limit.  Thats where I call it off (this road was a 45 MPH road, no traffic, looked safe enough to lay on the gas).<P>As a side not, I had an Integra driver pull up next to me the other day while doing 40 down the road.  He sped up and slowed down a couple times like he wanted to take off down the road.  I didn't bite figuring he would eat me alive.  I was right as he got tired of waiting and took off like a shot.  The car had an exhaust (a real one, not just fart-can) and probably some other stuff.  My thinking was at 40 MPH he was in the sweet spot of his VTEC while I was closer to where the 2.8L runs out of breath at higher RPMS. (I have an auto btw).  He lives around me and I want to find out what else he's done to the car, but haven't had a chance to catch him yet.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Mattyman||11-02-2001||11:01 PM||||Well, today on the way home from college, two punks both driving early model integras fly by me before a red light. I was suprised, no stickers, no parkbenches on the trunk, but one had a big fart cannon.  They were flying through traffic like they thought they were in race cars or something.  I got behind them at the light and the one kid in front of me just punched it, spun a little tire then slammed on the brakes because he almost hit his little buddy in front of him.  It was funny.  They were trying to show off and im still trying to figure out what they had to show off about.  The light turned green and they went flying away cutting people off.  I really dislike people like that.  I wish I didnt have to make the turn because I wanted to pull up next to them and just point and laugh.||||reg||1
